ata. This will help me convert the historical silver prices to their real value in a consistent monetary basis.\n\nThe calculation involves three key steps: calculating physical quantity, applying the real price, and computing a new nominal value that reflects current purchasing power. I'll need to research historical CPI data to complete this financial analysis accurately.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_7cefbf81c7ed47438e228277","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"cat /app/resources/manifest.json"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
